    "title": "HSRZ Preview: Easley Green Wave - NewsBreak",
    "text": "(WSPA) – High school football is back in the Carolinas! With the 2025 season just around the corner, the Easley Green Wave are previewed ahead of the August 22 kickoff. Easley Green Wave : Head Coach: Sam Houston, second season 2024 record: 1-9, 0-7 Key Returners: Jojo Coleman (QB), Matthew Hillstock (WR), Malachi Ramey (WR), Stone Turner (DL), Kobe Preston (ILB), Kaden Erby (CB), Cason Brewington (S) Preview: Sam Houston hopes for a better outcome in year two on the job and will rely on returning quarterback Jojo Coleman and playmakers like Matthew Hillstock and Malachi Ramey. Linebacker Kobe Preston leads the defense with lineman Stone Turner vital up front and cornerback Kaden Erby and safety Cason Brewington locking down the secondary. Check back weeknights on 7NEWS as more teams are previewed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WSPA 7NEWS.",
